OL,3,GNEWSA'Sick and abusive' rapist jailed
OL,4,Afor 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAli, from Sheffield, was found guilty
OL,7,Fafter a trial of 11 charges, including
OL,8,Fsix counts of rape, and was jailed for
OL,9,F20 years. Zarina and Mohammad were each
OL,10,Fjailed for three years two months for
OL,11,Ftheir part in the offending.
